      "id": "80166a8a"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# 极限\n",
        "\n",
        "## 实数\n",
        "\n",
        "### 整数与有理数\n",
        "\n",
        "通常用 $\\mathbb{N}$ 表示自然数集\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\mathbb{N} = \\{0,1,2,3,\\cdots\\}\n",
        "$$\n",
        "自然数集对加法运算封闭 (@def-closure) ，对减法运算不封闭\n",
        "\n",
        "整数集对减法封闭\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\mathbb{Z} = \\{0,\\pm1,\\pm2,\\pm3,\\cdots\\}\n",
        "$$\n",
        "整数集对乘法运算，对除法运算不封闭\n",
        "\n",
        "在整数集中添加两个整数的商，就得到了有理数集\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\mathbb{Q} =\\left\\{\\frac{p}{q}\\middle|p,q \\in \\mathbb{Z},q \\neq 0\\right\\}\n",
        "$$\n",
        "它对加减乘除四则运算封闭，也称 $\\mathbb{Q}$ 为有理数**域**（@def-field）\n",
        "\n",
        "有理数具有稠密性（@def-dense-in-R）\n",
        "\n",
        ":::{#def-closure}\n",
        "**封闭性**\n",
        "\n",
        "设 $S$ 是一个非空集合，$\\circ$ 是定义在 $S$ 上的一种运算。\n",
        "\n",
        "若 $\\forall a,b \\in S ,都有 a \\circ b \\in S$\n",
        "\n",
        "则称集合 $S$ 对该运算 $\\circ$ 是**封闭的**，或称 $S$ 具有**封闭性**\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        ":::{#def-field}\n",
        "**域**\n",
        "\n",
        "设 $\\mathbb{F}$ 是一个包含至少两个元素的集合，在 $\\mathbb{F}$ 上定义了两个运算：加法 $\\oplus$ 和乘法 $\\otimes$。如果对于 $\\forall a,b,c \\in \\mathbb{F}$，满足以下三大类**域公理**，则称 $\\mathbb{F}$ 为一个**域**。\n",
        "\n",
        "**（一）加法公理**\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **封闭性**：$a \\oplus b \\in \\mathbb{F}$\n",
        "2. **交换律**：$a \\oplus b = b \\oplus a$\n",
        "3. **结合律**：$(a \\oplus b)\\oplus c = a \\oplus(b \\oplus c)$\n",
        "4. **单位元**：存在元素 $0 \\in \\mathbb{F},\\text{ s.t. }a \\oplus 0 = a$\n",
        "5. **逆元**：存在元素 $-a \\in \\mathbb{F},\\text{ s.t. }a \\oplus (-a) = 0$\n",
        "\n",
        "**（二）乘法公理**\n",
        "\n",
        "6. **封闭性**：$a \\otimes b \\in \\mathbb{F}$\n",
        "7. **交换律**：$a \\otimes b = b \\otimes a$\n",
        "8. **结合律**：$(a \\otimes b) \\otimes c = a \\otimes(b \\otimes c)$\n",
        "9. **单位元**：存在元素 $1 \\in \\mathbb{F},\\text{ s.t. }a \\otimes 1 = a$\n",
        "10. **逆元**：若 $a \\neq 0$,则存在元素 $a^{-1} \\in \\mathbb{F},\\text{ s.t. }a \\otimes a^{-1} = 1$\n",
        "\n",
        "**（三）分配律**\n",
        "\n",
        "11. **乘法对加法的分配律**：$a \\otimes (b \\oplus c)= a \\otimes b \\oplus a \\otimes c$\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        ":::{.callout-note}\n",
        "这里的加法 $\\oplus$ 和乘法 $\\otimes$ 不一定是经典认知上的 $+$ 和 $\\times$ ，而也可以是其他运算，加法单位元和乘法单位元也不一定是0和1，比如：对于正实数集 $\\mathbb{R}_+$,在其中定义加法及乘法运算为\n",
        "$$\n",
        "a \\oplus b = ab\\quad(a,b \\in \\mathbb{R}_+) \\\\\n",
        "a \\otimes b = a^b\\quad(a,b \\in \\mathbb{R}_+)\n",
        "$$\n",
        "可以验证这种情况下， $\\mathbb{R}_+$ 是一个域，其加法单位元为1，乘法单位元也为1。\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        ":::{#def-dense-in-R}\n",
        "**（狭义）稠密性**\n",
        "设 $S$ 是实数集 $\\mathbb{R}$ 的一个子集。若\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\forall a,b \\in S,a \\neq b,\\exists c \\in S,\\text{s.t.} a<c<b\n",
        "$$\n",
        "则称集合 $S$ 在 $\\mathbb{R}$ 中**稠密**，或者称 $S$ 具有**稠密性**\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "### 十进制小数\n",
        "\n",
        "```{mermaid}\n",
        "graph TD\n",
        "    A[十进制小数] --> B[有限小数]\n",
        "    A --> C[无限小数]\n",
        "\n",
        "    B -->|属于| D((有理数集 Q))\n",
        "    C --> E[循环小数]\n",
        "    C --> F[不循环小数]\n",
        "\n",
        "    E -->|属于| D\n",
        "    F -->|属于| G((无理数集 R\\Q))\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "### 实数域\n",
        "\n",
        "实数域是对有理数域的扩充，除了对四则运算封闭外，还具有完备性(@def-completeness)。\n",
        "\n",
        "同时，实数域还是一个有序域。\n",
        "S\n",
        ":::{.callout-note}\n",
        "实数集 $\\mathbb{R}$ 由下列四组公理严格刻画：\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **域公理**（@def-field）\n",
        "2. **序公理**（@def-order-axioms）\n",
        "3. **阿基米德公理**（@def-archimedean）\n",
        "4. **完备性公理**（@def-completeness）\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        ":::{#def-completeness}\n",
        "设 $X$ 和 $Y$ 是实数集 $\\mathbb{R}$ 的两个非空子集，并满足对于任意 $x \\in X,y \\in Y$, 有 $x \\le y$,那么 $\\exists c \\in \\mathbb{R},\\text{s.t.}\\forall x \\in X,y \\in Y,x \\le c \\le y$.\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        ":::{#def-order-axioms}\n",
        "**序公理**\n",
        "设 $\\mathbb{R}$ 是一个域，如果在 $\\mathbb{R}$ 上定义了一个二元关系“ $\\le$ ”,且对于任意 $a,b,c \\in \\mathbb{R}$,满足以下四条规则，则称 $\\mathbb{R}$ 为一个**有序域**\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **三岐性**：$\\forall a,b \\in \\mathbb{R}$，有且满足以下三个式子之一：\n",
        "$$\n",
        "a < b,a = b,a > b\n",
        "$$\n",
        "2. **传递性**：若 $a \\le b,b \\le c$,那么 $a \\le c$.\n",
        "3. **加法保序性**：若 $a \\le b,c \\in \\mathbb{R}$，那么有：\n",
        "$$\n",
        "a + c \\le b + c\n",
        "$$\n",
        "4. **乘法保序性**：若 $a \\le b,c \\in \\mathbb{R},c > 0$,那么有：\n",
        "$$\n",
        "a \\cdot c \\le b \\cdot c\n",
        "$$\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        ":::{#def-archimedean}\n",
        "**阿基米德公理**\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\forall a,b > 0,\\exists n \\in \\mathbb{N},\\text{s.t.}\\quad n \\cdot a > b\n",
        "$$\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "### 数轴\n",
        "\n",
        "在直线 $l$ 上标定一个**原点**，并规定一个**正方向**，取一个长度为**单位长**。\n",
        "指定了原点、方向和单位长的直线称为**数轴**。"
      ],
      "id": "3c65fef6"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "fig-width": 6,
        "fig-height": 1.5
      },
      "source": [
        "#| echo: false\n",
        "#| fig-align: center\n",
        "\n",
        "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
        "import numpy as np\n",
        "\n",
        "plt.rcParams['font.sans-serif']=['SimHei']\n",
        "plt.rcParams['axes.unicode_minus']=False\n",
        "\n",
        "fig, ax = plt.subplots()\n",
        "\n",
        "ax.axis('off')\n",
        "ax.set_xlim(-1.5,5.5)\n",
        "ax.set_ylim(-0.3,0.4)\n",
        "\n",
        "ax.annotate('',xy=(5,0),xytext=(-1,0),arrowprops=dict(arrowstyle=\"->\",color='black',lw=1.5))\n",
        "ax.plot(0,0,'ko',markersize=5)\n",
        "ax.plot(1,0,'ko',markersize=5)\n",
        "ax.text(0,-0.1,'0',ha='center',va='top',fontsize=12)\n",
        "ax.text(1,-0.1,'1',ha='center',va='top',fontsize=12)\n",
        "ax.annotate('',xy=(0,0.1),xytext=(1,0.1),arrowprops=dict(arrowstyle=\"<->\",color='red',lw=1))\n",
        "ax.text(0.5,0.2,'单位长',ha='center',va='top',color='red',fontsize=10)\n",
        "ax.text(5.2,0,'x',ha='center',va='top',fontsize=12)\n",
        "ax.set_ylim(-0.6,0.6)\n",
        "\n",
        "plt.show()"
      ],
      "id": "ca6f3fd6",
      "execution_count": null,
